#: htmlexportwizard.cpp:34
msgid ""
"<QT>This wizard allows you to configure many different options\n"
"for your HTML image gallery. On this first page you can\n"
"configure the number of rows and columns of thumbnail previews\n"
"for each page, as well as the thumbnail size.\n"
"\n"
"<B>Tip:</B> If you use a standard thumbnail size PixiePlus can use existing\n"
"thumbnails on your hard drive, which is faster.</QT>"
